      "https://www.jetnation.com/2026/08/24/jets-traiing-camp-kicking-competition-stumbles/",
      "https://www.newyorkjets.com/news/2026-jets-unofficial-depth-chart",
      "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kenyon_Sadiq"
