      "https://theeagleswire.usatoday.com/story/sports/nfl/eagles/2026/08/14/eagles-eli-stowers-ravens-preseason-opener-blocking-development/91228224007/",
      "https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/eli-stowers-putting-extra-become-222721911.html",
      "https://www.nj.com/eagles/2026/08/an-eagles-rookie-is-being-called-a-disaster-and-getting-roasted-is-it-time-to-worry.html",
