      "https://www.baltimoreravens.com/news/ravens-eagles-game-preview-jesse-minter-jakobi-lane-preseason-opener-2026",
      "https://www.si.com/nfl/ravens/onsi/ravens-usage-of-ja-kobi-lane-in-preseason-debut-offers-huge-clues-about-his-future-01m08mm9bj00",
      "https://heavy.com/sports/nfl/baltimore-ravens/wide-receiver-jakobi-lane-nfl-debut/",
      "https://www.cbssports.com/fantasy/football/news/ravens-jakobi-lane-logs-one-catch-vs-minnesota/",
