        "source": "Pete Sweeney, Kansas City Star",
        "note": "In the preseason opener against the Rams, Johnson handled 12 carries for 59 yards and caught all three targets for 10 yards. He led Chiefs backs with 35 snaps, and a holding penalty erased a touchdown."
