    "classYear": "Redshirt Senior",
    "headline": "Bridgewater Walked Away and Handed Luke Altmyer the Keys to Detroit's QB2 Job",
    "subhead": "The undrafted Illinois captain has turned a $10,000 signing bonus into a genuine backup-quarterback battle with Josh Dobbs in Dan Campbell's building.",
    "draftPick": "Undrafted free agent, signed with the Detroit Lions after the 2026 NFL Draft",
